      <title>抛开工资谁还上班？价值感和成就感成了少数人的动力</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260903/%E6%8A%9B%E5%BC%80%E5%B7%A5%E8%B5%84%E8%B0%81%E8%BF%98%E4%B8%8A%E7%8F%AD%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%E6%84%9F%E5%92%8C%E6%88%90%E5%B0%B1%E6%84%9F%E6%88%90%E4%BA%86%E5%B0%91%E6%95%B0%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B/</link>
